      "widgets_values": [
        "DiT360 / FLUX - RoPE (shift) + VAE Circular Padding\\n\\nGoal: experiment with RoPE seam handling (attention-level) while keeping sampling padding low/zero.\\n\\nRecommended starting settings:\\n- ApplyCircularPanorama: patch_conv2d=false, patch_rope=true, rope_mode=shift, rope_seam_width=0 (auto).\\n- ApplyCircularPaddingVAE: inplace=true, x_axis_only=true.\\n- Equirect360KSampler.circular_padding=0 and Equirect360VAEDecode.circular_padding=0.\\n\\nIf results look washed out / broken:\\n- Turn patch_rope OFF first, or keep rope_mode=shift and set rope_seam_width to a small value (4-16).\\n- Avoid rope_mode=angle unless you are testing."
      ],
      "color": "#263",
      "bgcolor": "#385"
    },
